  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical assistance dairy Service, Training and Innovation Centers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen and realise the initial outcomes of the Strengthening Education in Agricultural Development project (SEAD) programme by Nuffic.The SEAD project has established a Service, Training and Innovation Centre (STIC)- called the Alpha Milk Factory - for dairy education in Musanze. In order to let the STIC fully thrive, in-depth training on dairy processing will be provided on the following topics:1.	Dairy, its chemistry and microbiology;2.	Yoghurt processing;3.	Ghee processing;4.	Quality control and quality assurance (cleaning);5.	Machine operations;6.	Tailored product development support;7.	Development of standard operating procedures (SOPs), good manufacturing practice (GMP), Good Hygiene Practices (GHP) and Hazard Analysis and Critical Control Points (HACCP);8.	Support on certification by Food and Drug Authority (FDA);9.	Coaching of the production manager.Furthermore, support on business development will be given, in order for the private partner Alpha Milk to establish a profitable business.</narrative>
  </description>
